{"about_the_game":"Sentris is a musical performance game. Make your own music as you Drop, Recycle, and Stack &quot;Sound Blocks&quot; into a spinning loop. Freestyle with a huge degree of musical control. Or focus on achieving the goal and let your song emerge organically.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Experimental music-based gameplay that enables personal expression and creativity<br />\r\n* Deceptively simple, challenging, and deep<br />\r\n* Play and Remix 20 levels with 12 musical voices, 12 key signatures, 7 musical modes, and up to 400 beats per minute<br />\r\n* Freestyle to perform the game like a musical instrument<br />\r\n* Export your loops to .wav and use them in other music/audio software<br />\r\n* Endless mode with infinite musical emergence","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/303530?t=1740413892","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740413892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740413892","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740413892","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Sentris is a musical performance game. Make your own music as you Drop, Recycle, and Stack &quot;Sound Blocks&quot; into a spinning loop. Freestyle with a huge degree of musical control. Or focus on achieving the goal and let your song emerge organically.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Experimental music-based gameplay that enables personal expression and creativity<br />\r\n* Deceptively simple, challenging, and deep<br />\r\n* Play and Remix 20 levels with 12 musical voices, 12 key signatures, 7 musical modes, and up to 40